# ==============================================================================
# E-BUILDCON ENTERPRISES - CLOUD BACKEND (FIREBASE FIRESTORE)
# ==============================================================================
# Follow these 3 easy steps to connect your live Cloud Database:
#
# 1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com/ and create a free project: "ebuildcon"
# 2. In Project Settings, click the Web icon (</>) to create a Web App.
# 3. Under Firestore Database in the sidebar, click "Create database" (Start in Test mode or Production).
# 4. Copy and paste your config values into .env:
# ==============================================================================

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyYourApiKeyHere
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=ebuildcon-portal.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=ebuildcon-portal
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=ebuildcon-portal.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=123456789012
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:123456789012:web:abcdef123456789
